  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Similarly,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>32</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mn>32</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>32</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mn>32</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mn>32</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br />Given,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>32</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mn>32</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>32</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mn>32</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mn>32</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>On comparing <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mn>32</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> &amp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mn>32</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, we get,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>64</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
